# Internal working record, deliberately not published.
docs/AUDIT_V0.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Process and decision records — deliberately NOT published.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The remote is the public repository. These are working documents: the
# reasoning behind decisions, the naming record, the internal audit, and
# everything staged for disclosure or submission. They belong on the author's
# machine and nowhere else.
#
# Listed explicitly rather than by a wildcard so that adding a new private
# document is a deliberate act, and so that this list can be read as an
# inventory of what must never travel.
# These files now LIVE in the sibling vault (../Swarmbly-Private/), not here.
# They are listed anyway so that a copy landing back in this tree -- by an
# extraction, a restore, or a hand that meant well -- is refused by git rather
# than caught by a reader. The rule that put them there is in the vault's
# README: a document is public if some public artifact points at it. Nothing
# public points at any of these.
docs/AUDIT_V0.md
docs/DISCUSION_PUNTOS.*
docs/NAMING.*
docs/RESOLUCIONES.*
docs/Swarmbly_AI_Documento_Maestro_ES.*
docs/Swarmbly_AI_Master_Document_EN.*
docs/PLAN_V7.*
docs/RUNBOOK_2026-09-04.*
docs/FUNDAMENTOS_*
docs/AUDIT_VERSIONING*
docs/Swarmbly_AI_Dashboard.html
docs/Swarmbly_AI_Explicativo.html
publication/
_interno/
_to_delete/
_audit_*.txt
